Added :attr:`vMonth.ical_value <icalendar.prop.recur.month.vMonth.ical_value>`, which returns the month number as an :class:`int`. For :rfc:`7529` leap months such as ``5L``, the leap flag stays available as :attr:`~icalendar.prop.recur.month.vMonth.leap`. I used Claude Opus 5.5 to help choose the return type and draft some of the tests. @jakkoyang